[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: MIL-STD-498 DBDD (Database Design Description)

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: DBDD-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Database Design
STATEMENT: The system shall use PostgreSQL database with normalized schema design and optimized queries.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: DBDD-002
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Data Models
STATEMENT: The system shall implement comprehensive data models for satellite configurations, network topology, and operational data.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: DBDD-003
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Data Integrity
STATEMENT: The system shall enforce referential integrity, constraints, and validation rules for data consistency.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: DBDD-004
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Performance Optimization
STATEMENT: The system shall implement database indexing, query optimization, and connection pooling for optimal performance.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.